import examples/ribbon/interface.dl
import lib/ui_resize.dl

window nested pins:
    a UI component 12 labeled "Panel" styled "plain" at 20 20 sized 200 by 100 containing [icon command "Inner" with icon "save" at 20 20 sized 30 by 30]
    icon command "Centered" with icon "save" at 80 20 sized 30 by 30
    icon command "Footer" with icon "save" at 20 180 sized 30 by 20
    style:
        pin "Panel" to all edges
        pin "Inner" to the bottom right
        center "Centered" horizontally
        pin "Footer" to the bottom left

set state to 0
set instance to an instance of ribbon studio with state (the address of state)
set layout to a UI layout for ribbon studio inside ribbon studio with width 1280 using (the UI theme for ribbon studio)
prepare UI layout layout for ribbon studio sized 1280 by 800
set editor to the UI layout labeled "Editor" in layout
set ribbon to the UI layout labeled "Main ribbon" in layout
set share to the UI layout labeled "Share" in layout
set status to the UI layout labeled "Normal view" in layout
set font to the UI layout labeled "Aptos (Body)" in layout
set original to font's bounds
set the value of "Main ribbon" in (the address of instance) to 2
set the text of "Aptos (Body)" in (the address of instance) to "Georgia"

resize UI layout layout to 1600 by 800
require condition ((editor's bounds' width = 1600.0) and (editor's bounds' height = 800.0)) reporting "The canvas did not stretch horizontally"
require condition ((share's bounds' x = 1436.0) and (share's bounds' y = 14.0)) reporting "The top-right button did not retain its edge margins"
require condition ((share's bounds' width = 92.0) and (ribbon's bounds' height = 168.0)) reporting "Resizing magnified the controls"
resize UI layout layout to 1280 by 1000
require condition ((status's bounds' x = 997.0) and (status's bounds' y = 979.0)) reporting "The status control did not follow the bottom edge"
require condition ((ribbon's bounds' y = 56.0) and (ribbon's bounds' height = 168.0)) reporting "A height-only resize moved the ribbon"
resize UI layout layout to 960 by 600
require condition ((ribbon's bounds' width = 936.0) and (ribbon's bounds' height = 168.0)) reporting "A narrow ribbon changed height instead of scrolling"
set tab to ribbon's first
loop while tab != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout):
    set group to tab's first
    loop while group != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout):
        require condition (group's bounds' y = 0.0) reporting "A ribbon group wrapped to another row"
        set group to group's next
    set tab to tab's next
set home to ribbon's first's next
set span to the ribbon viewport width for home in ribbon
set limit to the ribbon scroll limit for home within span
set earlier to ribbon's first
loop while earlier's node's kind != 38:
    set earlier to earlier's next
set later to earlier's next
set the value of "Main ribbon" in (the address of instance) to 1
require condition ((span = 876.0) and (limit > 0.0)) reporting "An overflowing ribbon did not reserve space for its arrows"
require condition ((UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false) reporting "The previous arrow was visible at the start"
require condition (UI ribbon arrow later is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) reporting "The next arrow was hidden before the final group"
scroll ribbon tab home in direction 1 within span
require condition ((home's scroll target > 0.0) and (home's scroll target <= limit)) reporting "The next-group arrow did not advance the strip"
require condition ((UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false) reporting "The previous arrow appeared before the strip moved"
set position to home's scroll target
set design to home's next's next
scroll ribbon tab design in direction 1 within (the ribbon viewport width for design in ribbon)
require condition (home's scroll target = position) reporting "Scrolling another tab moved the first tab"
set index to 0
loop while index < 12:
    scroll ribbon tab home in direction 1 within span
    increment index
require condition (home's scroll target = limit) reporting "Scrolling overshot the final group"
require condition (UI ribbon arrow later is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) reporting "The next arrow disappeared before the strip reached its target"
set home's scroll position to limit
require condition ((UI ribbon arrow later is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false) reporting "The next arrow was visible at the end"
require condition (UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) reporting "The previous arrow was hidden at the end"
set index to 0
loop while index < 12:
    scroll ribbon tab home in direction -1 within span
    increment index
require condition (home's scroll target = 0.0) reporting "The previous-group arrow did not return to the start"
require condition (UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) reporting "The previous arrow disappeared before the strip returned"
set home's scroll position to 0.0
require condition ((UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false) reporting "The previous arrow was visible after returning to the start"
set selectedControl to the UI layout labeled "Select" in layout
set selectedControl's order to 77
set group to home's first
loop while group != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout):
    reveal UI control ordered 77 in group at 0.0 within span for home
    set group to group's next
require condition ((home's scroll target > 0.0) and (home's scroll target <= limit)) reporting "Keyboard focus did not reveal an offscreen control"
resize UI layout layout to 2400 by 1200
require condition ((home's scroll position = 0.0) and (design's scroll target = 0.0)) reporting "Widening the ribbon left an obsolete scroll offset"
require condition (((UI ribbon arrow earlier is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false) and ((UI ribbon arrow later is visible in layout for (the address of instance)) = false)) reporting "An arrow was visible when all groups fit"
set the value of "Main ribbon" in (the address of instance) to 2
resize UI layout layout to 960 by 600
resize UI layout layout to 1280 by 800
require condition ((share's bounds' x = 1116.0) and (status's bounds' y = 779.0)) reporting "Repeated resizing accumulated position errors"
require condition ((font's bounds' x = original's x) and (font's bounds' width = original's width)) reporting "A field's geometry changed after restoring the window size"
require condition ((the selected tab of (ribbon's node) in (the address of instance))'s text = "Insert") reporting "Resizing reset the selected tab"
require condition (((the UI value for (font's node) in (the address of instance))'s text) = "Georgia") reporting "Resizing reset a selected field value"
release UI layout layout
close the address of instance
set nested to a UI layout for nested pins inside nested pins with width 300 using (the UI theme for nested pins)
prepare UI layout nested for nested pins sized 300 by 200
resize UI layout nested to 500 by 400
set inner to the UI layout labeled "Inner" in nested
set centered to the UI layout labeled "Centered" in nested
set footer to the UI layout labeled "Footer" in nested
require condition ((inner's bounds' x = 220.0) and (inner's bounds' y = 220.0)) reporting "A nested control did not retain its parent-relative margins"
require condition ((centered's bounds' x = 180.0) and (centered's bounds' y = 20.0)) reporting "A centered control lost its horizontal offset"
require condition ((footer's bounds' x = 20.0) and (footer's bounds' y = 380.0)) reporting "A bottom-left control moved horizontally"
resize UI layout nested to 300 by 200
require condition ((inner's bounds' x = 20.0) and (inner's bounds' y = 20.0)) reporting "Nested resizing accumulated position errors"
release UI layout nested
set clipped to the UI intersection of (UI box at -20 10 sized 80 40) and (UI box at 0 0 sized 30 100)
require condition ((clipped's x = 0.0) and ((clipped's y = 10.0) and ((clipped's width = 30.0) and (clipped's height = 40.0)))) reporting "The clipping region did not intersect the visible bounds"
print line "UI resize passed"
